/* Settings guidance */
"Personalize the app icon. To switch Chinese or English, open iOS Settings > Apps > SideStore > Language, then reopen SideStore." = "可在此更换应用图标。如需切换中文或英文，请打开“系统设置 → App → SideStore → 语言”，选择语言后重新打开 SideStore。";
"Health Check verifies signing and network readiness; Error Log helps diagnose failures; Storage Explorer shows SideStore files; Clear Cache removes temporary data without deleting installed apps." = "“健康检查”用于确认签名与网络是否就绪；“错误日志”用于排查失败原因；“存储浏览器”用于查看 SideStore 文件；“清理缓存”只删除临时数据，不会删除已安装的 App。";
"Feedback reports issues; Refresh Attempts shows refresh history; SideJITServer configures JIT; Pairing File repairs device communication; Anisette Servers support Apple ID authentication; Connection Configuration controls networking; Developer Portal Services manages App IDs, devices, and profiles; Certificate Management manages signing certificates; Backup & Restore protects data; User Customizations contains expert options." = "“发送反馈”用于报告问题；“刷新尝试”查看刷新记录；“SideJITServer”配置 JIT；“配对文件”用于修复设备通信；“Anisette 服务器”支持 Apple ID 认证；“连接配置”管理网络连接；“开发者门户服务”管理 App ID、设备和描述文件；“证书管理”管理签名证书；“备份与恢复”保护数据；“用户自定义”包含高级选项。";
"Developer Options controls logs, database, and WireGuard tools. Experimental Features contains unstable switches intended only for troubleshooting or testing." = "“开发者选项”管理日志、数据库和 WireGuard 工具；“实验性功能”包含尚不稳定的开关，仅建议在排障或测试时使用。";
"Choose a method to send feedback:" = "选择反馈方式：";
"Send Email" = "发送邮件";

/* Settings information architecture */
"Change the app icon or open system settings to change the app language." = "更换应用图标，或打开系统设置切换应用语言。";
"Change Language" = "切换语言";
"Apps refresh automatically on Wi-Fi. Use Disable Idle Timeout only when a refresh or install must keep the device awake." = "连接 Wi‑Fi 时可自动刷新 App。仅在刷新或安装期间需要保持设备唤醒时，启用“禁用空闲超时”。";
"Tools for checking status, troubleshooting failures, and managing temporary data." = "用于检查状态、排查故障和管理临时数据的工具。";
"Advanced tools for pairing, authentication, certificates, networking, and backups. Most users can leave these unchanged." = "用于配对、认证、证书、网络和备份的高级工具。大多数用户无需修改。";
"Optional preview updates. These builds may be unstable." = "可选的预览更新，可能存在不稳定情况。";
"Troubleshooting and experimental tools. Change these only when diagnosing a problem." = "用于排障和测试的工具，仅在诊断问题时修改。";
"Refreshing Apps" = "刷新 App";
"Tools" = "工具";
"Advanced settings overview" = "高级设置概览";
"Keep the device awake while SideStore refreshes or installs an app." = "SideStore 刷新或安装 App 时保持设备唤醒。";
"Refresh apps automatically when the device is connected to Wi-Fi." = "设备连接 Wi‑Fi 时自动刷新 App。";
"Use the switches only when needed. Keeping unnecessary background activity enabled may increase battery usage." = "仅在需要时启用开关。长期启用不必要的后台活动可能增加耗电。";
"Check signing, network connectivity, pairing, and device readiness." = "检查签名、网络连接、配对和设备就绪状态。";
"Review diagnostic logs when an operation fails." = "操作失败时查看诊断日志。";
"Inspect files stored by SideStore. Do not delete files unless you know what they are." = "查看 SideStore 保存的文件。除非确认用途，否则不要删除。";
"Remove temporary data. Installed apps are not deleted." = "删除临时数据，不会删除已安装的 App。";
"These options control authentication, pairing, certificates, networking, backups, and developer services. Change them only when you understand the effect." = "这些选项控制认证、配对、证书、网络、备份和开发者服务。了解影响后再修改。";
"Developer and experimental tools are intended for troubleshooting or testing." = "开发者工具和实验性工具仅用于排障或测试。";

